      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables and values\n    intercept = 0.0477\n    underwriter_rank = 6\n    pre_offer_price_adjustment = 0.04\n    offer_size = 40\n    fraction_retained = 0.70\n\n    underwriter_rank_coefficient = 0.0150\n    pre_offer_coefficient = 0.4350\n    offer_size_coefficient = -0.0009\n    fraction_retained_coefficient = 0.0500\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the anticipated initial return\n    anticipated_return = (\n        intercept\n        + underwriter_rank_coefficient * underwriter_rank\n        + pre_offer_coefficient * pre_offer_price_adjustment\n        + offer_size_coefficient * offer_size\n        + fraction_retained_coefficient * fraction_retained\n    )\n\n    # Return answer rounded to three decimal places\n    return round(anticipated_return, 3)\n```",
